{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": "Implementation-neutral inputs for cut/render parity. Times in 'rel' are seconds relative to the timeline start of the FIRST buffered segment (seg0.t_start). Timeline mapping used to build the index: received_at = T0 + pts_end + latency, so t = pts + T0 + latency (offset = min(received_at - pts_end)).",
